                  <items count="4">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Opossum provides model-based, gradient-free, and global optimization with single and multiple objectives. Its GUI is based on Galapagos; the optimization back-end relies on the RBFOpt library (https://projects.coin-or.org/RBFOpt/wiki), CMA-ES (https://github.com/CMA-ES/pycma), and pygmo (https://esa.github.io/pygmo2/).</item>
